🚨Have you heard of “deed theft”? This indictment announced today by WDKYnews and U.S. Attorney Kyle Bumgarner alleges that multiple defendants conspired to create and file fraudulent deeds and illegally took over homes in Louisville, often stealing property after the true owner died without a will. 

💥These defendants will now face justice in federal court.
